            "<img srcset=\"http://example.com/a.jpg 1x, http://example.com/b.jpg 2x\">", "http://example.com/");
        Cleaner cleaner = new Cleaner(safelist());
        assertEquals(cleaner.clean(dirty).body().html(), cleaner.clean(dirty).body().html());
